---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base lang="zh" title="404 - 页面未找到 / Page Not Found">
  <section class="min-h-[70vh] flex items-center justify-center py-20 px-4 bg-surface">
    <div class="max-w-md w-full text-center bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-xl border border-slate-200">
      <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-primary-light text-primary rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
        <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z" />
        </svg>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-navy mb-2 font-mono">404</h1>
      <p class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mb-1">页面未找到 / Page Not Found</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
        抱歉，您访问的页面不存在或已移至新地址。<br />
        The page you are looking for does not exist or has been moved.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center">
        <a
          href="/zh/"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold text-white bg-primary hover:bg-primary-hover shadow-sm transition-colors"
        >
          返回中文首页
        </a>
        <a
          href="/en/"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 transition-colors"
        >
          Go to English Home
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
